message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the related prior work where relevant."
title: "arc-principle-validation: the code, data, results and papers of the ARC Theory research programme"
abstract: "The code, data, results and papers of Michael Darius Eastwood's research programme in Recursive Dynamics and its ARC Theory of recursive self-improvement. The programme lists 36 documents; this repository holds 35 of them (all but the Priority Index, which is held on OSF), one per folder under papers/, with the code, data and results of its experiments. Every document is listed under references."
type: software
authors:
