url: "https://www.michaeldariuseastwood.com/research/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MichaelDariusEastwood/arc-principle-validation"
keywords:
  - Recursive Dynamics
  - ARC Theory
  - AI alignment
  - AI safety
  - recursive self-improvement
  - scaling laws
  - blinded evaluation
  - replication
  - preregistration
  - Eden Protocol
